  "notes": "{戦|たたか}う is a godan verb meaning to fight, battle, or struggle.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{戦|たたか}う: to fight against X\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{戦|たたか}う: to fight for X (cause)\n\nUSAGE:\n- ⟦{戦争|せんそう}→戦争：01450_sensou⟧: war, combat\n- ⟦スポーツ→スポーツ：04740_supootsu⟧: sports competitions\n- ⟦{病気|びょうき}→病気：00771_byouki⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{戦|たたか}う: to fight illness\n- ⟦{困難|こんなん}→困難：01410_konnan⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{戦|たたか}う: to struggle against hardship\n\nWRITING:\n- {戦|たたか}う: general fighting, war (⟦{戦争|せんそう}→戦争：01450_sensou⟧)\n- ⟦{闘|たたか}う→闘う：17304_tatakau⟧: struggle, battle (⟦{闘争|とうそう}→闘争：14574_tousou⟧)\nBoth are read たたかう; ⟦{闘|たたか}う→闘う：17304_tatakau⟧ emphasizes intense struggle.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{戦|たたか}い→戦い：02070_tatakai⟧: fight, battle (noun)\n- ⟦{戦士|せんし}→戦士：12747_senshi⟧: warrior\n- ⟦{戦闘|せんとう}→戦闘：12639_sentou⟧: combat",
